[{"sha":"b33de7ca35e29b95aa8a7671343f3174be9eda6e","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGIzM2RlN2NhMzVlMjliOTVhYThhNzY3MTM0M2YzMTc0YmU5ZWRhNmU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b33de7ca35e29b95aa8a7671343f3174be9eda6e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b33de7ca35e29b95aa8a7671343f3174be9eda6e","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-28T09:21:18Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-04-28T09:21:18Z"},"tree":{"sha":"905da505778e992847ed1ef73dfa4bb49f7a86d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/905da505778e992847ed1ef73dfa4bb49f7a86d0"},"message":"policy/v2: fix empty grants/acls returning FilterAllowAll\n\ncompileFilterRules, compileGrants, and updateLocked guarded the\n\"no rules so allow all\" fallback with len(pol.Grants) == 0, which\nmatches both an absent grants field and an explicit empty array.\nJSON {\"grants\": []} unmarshals to a non-nil empty slice; it should\ncompile to zero filter rules (deny all) to match Tailscale SaaS,\nbut the length check sent it down the FilterAllowAll path.\n\nDistinguish absent (nil) from explicit-empty by switching the guard\nto pol.Grants == nil, the same asymmetry already used for ACLs.\n{} keeps allowing all; {\"acls\": []} and {\"grants\": []} now both\ndeny all.\n\nFixes #3211","parents":[{"sha":"3672a2df3a860bcb97f932d3dc7785406329b49e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/3672a2df3a860bcb97f932d3dc7785406329b49e","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/3672a2df3a860bcb97f932d3dc7785406329b49e"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":24946571988,"node_id":"RFRE_lADOEFLz888AAAABAs2Mas8AAAAFzu561A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/24946571988","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":